  28.10.2023  ZIS  prvnÌ verze
  29.12.2023  ZIS  - DoplnÏnÌ a opravy koment·¯e, zmÏna stavu viditelnosti konstant a struktur s cÌlem skr˝t ty, kterÈ nejsou pro uûivatele uûiteËnÈ.
                   - V fbDL2_ComControl zmÏna podmÌnek spuötenÌ pocÌtadla Watchdog, aby se zabr·nilo zaseknutÌ.
                   - Oprava skenov·nÌ sÌtÏ, nynÌ zaËÌn· od adresy 0 
                   - Odstr·nenie vybranÈ scÈny/scÈn po vykonanÌ.
                   - Omezeni vyberu aktualizace v˝konu predradnÌku pri skupinovÈm povelu
                   - OdstranenÌ vybranÈ skupiny po provedenÌ prÌkazu.
                   - DrobnÈ kosmetickÈ ˙pravy

  04.04.2024  ZIS  - Prid·na podpora relÈ DALI
  
  21.05.2024  ZIS  - Oprava zpoûdenÌ pri odesÌl·nÌ vÌce skupinov˝ch prÌkazu najednou.
                   - P¯id·ni funkËnÌho bloku fbDL2_GroupLevelSet pro usnadnÏnÌ vysÌlanÌ skupinov˝ch p¯Ìkazu

  30.07.2024  ZIS  - Prid·na podpora nouzovÈho osvetlenÌ DALI 

  25.11.2025  ZIS  - Opravena chyba v ovl·d·nÌ scÈn
                   - Do funkËnÌho bloku ÑfbDL2_GroupLevelSetì byla p¯id·na podmÌnka pro odesl·nÌ skupinovÈho p¯Ìkazu p¯i zmÏnÏ hodnoty Ñlevelì.

{ENG}
  28.10.2023  ZIS  first release
  29.12.2023  ZIS  - Additions and corrections to the comment, changing the visibility status of constants and structures to hide those that are not useful to the user
                   - In fbDL2_ComControl, change the conditions for starting the Watchdog counter to prevent stuck.
                   - Fix network scanning, now starts from address 0
                   - Delete selected scene/scenes after execution
                   - Restriction of ballast power update selection during group command
                   - Delete the selected group after executing the command.
                   - Minor cosmetic adjustments

  04.04.2024  ZIS  - Added DALI relay support

  21.05.2024  ZIS  - Adding a function block fbDL2_GroupLevelSet to facilitate sending group commands

  30.07.2024  ZIS  - Added supporting of DALI emergency lighting

  25.11.2025  ZIS  - Fixed scene control bug
                   - A condition for sending a group command when the "level" value changes has been added to the "fbDL2_GroupLevelSet" function block.
*)

